## 1. Overall Vision & Strategy

Vinea ERP aims to be a modern, comprehensive solution for small to medium-sized enterprises, providing an intuitive interface and powerful backend capabilities. We will leverage a proven technology stack and an iterative development approach. This document serves as the primary Product Requirements Document (PRD) and Development Roadmap.

## 2. Technology Stack

**Frontend:** Next.js (App Router), React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Tanstack React Query, Zustand (for global state if needed beyond AuthContext), Axios, React Hook Form, Zod, Lucide-react, js-cookie.

**Backend:** FastAPI, Python 3.9+, SQLAlchemy (with Alembic), PostgreSQL, JWT for Authentication, Bcrypt for Hashing.

**Containerization:** Docker, Docker Compose.

**Testing:** Pytest (backend), Jest/React Testing Library (frontend), Cypress/Playwright (E2E - Phase 13).

## 3. Overall Approach for AI Collaboration

- **Iterative Development:** Each phase will be completed, thoroughly tested at its level, and confirmed by the AI before proceeding to the next.
- **Absolute Clarity in Instructions:** Each task will be described with specific actions, target files, function signatures, expected UI behavior, and data flows.
- **Dependency Awareness:** Instructions will explicitly state dependencies on functionalities or data structures created in previous phases.
- **Mandatory Confirmation:** At the conclusion of each phase, the AI MUST explicitly confirm completion of all specified tasks.
- **Robustness and Quality First:** Strong emphasis on comprehensive testing, meticulous error handling, and security best practices.
- **Intent-Based UI Focus:** The user interface will be organized around user intents (Maintenance, Transactions, Reports).

